<div class="mx-auto max-w-md">
  <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">忘记密码</h1>
    <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">输入注册邮箱，我们会向你发送密码重置链接（1 小时内有效）。</p>

    <form method="post" action="/forgot-password" class="mt-6 space-y-4">
      <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>" />
      <div>
        <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">邮箱</label>
        <input type="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email"
               class="mt-1 block w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm shadow-sm focus:border-brand-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-100" />
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="w-full inline-flex justify-center rounded-lg bg-brand-600 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-brand-700">发送重置邮件</button>
    </form>

    <div class="mt-6 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 p-3 text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
      <p>📬 出于安全考虑，无论邮箱是否存在我们都会显示相同提示，避免泄露注册信息。</p>
      <p class="mt-1">⏱ 重置链接 <strong>1 小时内有效</strong>，且只能使用一次。设置新密码后所有已登录设备会被强制下线。</p>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-6 text-center text-sm text-slate-500">
      想起来了？<a href="/login" class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 font-medium">返回登录</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
